"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4931690","error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-4687990","metric":"price_final","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:08Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4687990,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"currency":null,"divisor":100,"initial":null,"discount_percent":null,"is_free":false,"formatted_final_price":null,"is_free_field_present":false,"is_coming_soon":true,"is_coming_soon_field_present":true},"error_code":"price_not_announced"},{"game_id":"steam-4687990","metric":"review_count","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:08Z","status":"ok","value":0,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4687990,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-4687990","metric":"review_positive_percent","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:08Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4687990,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4687990-1847286114042951","game_id":"steam-4687990","kind":"announcement","title":"VOID PROFIT Devlog #13: Still in the cockpit","summary":"Hello. I've been making the screens feel more at home in the cockpit. Same chair, same rented ship. Closer to the consoleOpening a screen now zooms towards the main console, with a little CRT channel change. Close it and the camera pulls back. Doesn't look extremely realistic but it didn't feel like that anyway. This incorporates the screens UI into the cockpit in a better way. A bit less emptyThe layout for trading has been changed a bit so it's no longer just a column of cargo data. A bit more","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T20:44:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114042951","verified_at":"2026-10-26T03:38:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4687990-1847286114031401","game_id":"steam-4687990","kind":"update","title":"VOID PROFIT Hotfix #1","summary":"A few more fixes from the demo feedback, plus some pricing tweaks. Startup and settings fixes, safer saving and improved Steam Cloud support.Travel resumes properly after patrol inspections once outstanding decisions are resolved.Clearer rent payments and receipts, with early payment available shortly before rent is due at the Aetrocor Representative Service. Pricing tweaks for repairs, fuel, cargo handling and market information.Market feeds update more often and price estimates are more useful","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T06:30:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114031401","verified_at":"2026-10-22T10:37:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4687990-1846651706689875","game_id":"steam-4687990","kind":"announcement","title":"VOID PROFIT Devlog #12: Two weeks to release, and after that","summary":"Hello, Two weeks until VOID PROFIT releases on November 2. Getting close. I've also been putting together some plans for what comes afterward. Everything below is for after 1.0.0, starting with Jobs and world events. Then, a while later, a bigger update around attacking ships and mining moons. Current gameplay: planning a route. More room to negotiate Some of the first things I want to get to are fairly small. Negotiating how much of a shipment you take, for example. A job that's too large for y","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T11:52:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689875","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:58:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4687990-1846651706674158","game_id":"steam-4687990","kind":"announcement","title":"VOID PROFIT Devlog #11: More life","summary":"Hello,The latest VOID PROFIT update is the one I called \"More life\". Space in front of your ship was looking a bit empty, so I've been putting other ships in it.Outside your cameraFreighters, shuttles and the occasional military traffic now pass through the cockpit view. They have their own places to be, their own stuff to do. You can keep dealing with your cargo while someone else flies past the planet outside. I wanted the world to feel occupied without constantly demanding your attention. Thi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T12:31:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706674158","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:58:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4687990-1844115010501679","game_id":"steam-4687990","kind":"announcement","title":"VOID PROFIT Devlog #10: Still company property","summary":"Hello, I've been working on the cockpit, the look of the game and the Charter and Ledger systems mentioned in the last update. This is a look at what's changed in the development build, including a better explanation of how those systems work. The cockpit needed work You spend most of the game sitting in this thing. It should feel like a place, and quite a lot of it still looked flat. I've been working on the depth of the panels, how the screens sit inside them and where the light falls. The mai","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-21T15:16:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010501679","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:58:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4687990-1841579228669993","game_id":"steam-4687990","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest ending this weekend. Findings and a new Roadmap.","summary":"Hello, There's been some silence surrounding the game as I've been focusing on fixing playtest issues and clearing up the demo before its release. Here's a quick update on what's happening. 1. The end of the first playtestThis weekend, on Sunday, I'll be deactivating the currently running playtest to focus on bigger changes. If you have any last minute feedback, going to the Discord is still the best option. The playtest ran for a lot longer than expected. Went from a month to two months of smal","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T20:20:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228669993","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:58:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4687990-1836506165546694","game_id":"steam-4687990","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest Starting Soon","summary":"A VOID PROFIT playtest will be starting soon. The start of July is the test start range. This is a pre-demo playtest that will be indicative of the whole experience of playing the game. A demo will be released in the weeks following the playtest for people who will be more interested in playing a section of the game without the requirement of giving feedback. The ProcessThis will be a regular playtest requested through Steam. There will be a Request Access button for the playtest build. After th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-24T17:16:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165546694","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:58:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4687990-1833968530885213","game_id":"steam-4687990","kind":"announcement","title":"VOID PROFIT Devlog #9 - Keep the manifest clean","summary":"VOID PROFIT Devlog #9: Keep the manifest cleanA new game system has been addedThe manifest systemA new game system that expands on the current gameplay has been added. It's the manifest system. You now have to keep a manifest for your cargo. BUT DON'T WORRY! It gets automatically populated when you buy or sell cargo. You just need to \"File\" and/or change it. You need to declare your cargo to avoid issues with authorities when docking or during inspection stops.The new gameplay this createsThis o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-27T12:03:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530885213","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:58:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4687990-1832700592785852","game_id":"steam-4687990","kind":"announcement","title":"VOID PROFIT Devlog #8: Authored Dialogue","summary":"VOID PROFIT Devlog #8: Authored DialogueA massive overhaul of the dialogue system has been implementedA more natural dialogue systemBefore this change dialogue was constructed from different lines based on world, player and market states. As the variety of states changed, this dialogue was starting to feel extremely unnatural. Appending, prepending and inserting lines into the NPC dialogue turned into nothing but a series of dialogue snippets stitched together (which it was). Now the system has ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-13T09:59:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592785852","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:58:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4687990-1832065502811012","game_id":"steam-4687990","kind":"announcement","title":"VOID PROFIT Devlog #7: Deepening Gameplay","summary":"VOID PROFIT Devlog #7: Deepening GameplayMade some changes that should deepen gameplay and improve emergent gameplay possibilities.Pirate GuildThe Pirate Guild was just a major/core faction. They behaved like everyone else and, since they don't have any cargo they consider illegal, were just a nuisance. Now they act completely differently. Traveling through other factions' area will mean that you'll have to pay close attention to routes you're taking if you have illegal cargo or outstanding fine","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-07T06:19:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502811012","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:58:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4687990":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:37:22Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:37:22Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4687990":"2026-10-26T13:37:22Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4687990":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:37:22Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:37:22Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:37:22Z"},"4931690":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:37:22Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:37:22Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:37:22Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4687990","app_id":4687990,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:47Z","source_ur